  "title": "Grilled Chicken Quesadillas",
  "description": "This recipe is a delicious snap. The meat is coated with adobo seasoning, grilled, and cut into bite-sized pieces. Then a tortilla is layered with cheese, chile peppers, chicken, and olives.",
  "authors": [
